        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur FAVFAV19, Fifth Avenue Knob with Matching Tall Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Fifth Avenue Knob with Matching Tall Plate is made for bigger doors where you do not want your beautiful knobset to be swallowed by a large room or door. The Fifth Avenue Tall Plate is 11 inches tall and 2.65 inches wide, perfect for adding a proportional door knob to a tall interior door. The Grandeur Fifth Avenue Tall Plate with Fifth Avenue Knob is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions and is available in a wide array of popular finishes including oil rubbed bronze, polished brass, and satin nickel. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available <a href=\"/products/single-cylinder-fifth-avenue-tall-plate-entryset-grandeur-favfav19entr\"><b>Single Cylinder Fifth Avenue Tall Plate Entryset.</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur Fifth Avenue Tall Plate with Fifth Avenue Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Fifth Avenue 11 Inch Tall Plate Knobset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2.24\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2.24\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 11\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 2.65\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Projection: .39\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 8-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/8\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-FAVFAV19-specifications.pdf?v=1704262393\" target=\"new\"><b>Grandeur FAVFAV19 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting A Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for one side of door. This inactive pull is usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> Surfaced mounted, non-working knobs. Non-locking and non-latching trim for both sides of door. These inactive pulls are usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> Latches but does not lock. The latch is activated by turning the either of the two knobs.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> Latches and can be locked. Can be locked from the inside with a push-button.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</li>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Fifth Avenue Tall Plate",
                "description": "The Fifth Avenue Knob with Matching Tall Plate is made for bigger doors where you do not want your beautiful knobset to be swallowed by a large room or door. The Fifth Avenue Tall Plate is 11 inches tall and 2.65 inches wide, perfect for adding a proportional door knob to a tall interior door. The Grandeur Fifth Avenue Tall Plate with Fifth Avenue Knob is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions and is available in a wide array of popular finishes including oil rubbed bronze, polished brass, and satin nickel. \r\n",
